{
  "title": "Silver Moon? Crimson Moon?",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub-dialogue\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f8/Verina_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_05_02.gif/revision/latest?cb=20240512065701\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Verina Sticker Slice of Life 05 02\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f8/Verina_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_05_02.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240512065701\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Verina Sticker Slice of Life 05 02.gif\" data-image-key=\"Verina_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_05_02.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Dialogue_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Dialogue Stubs\">page</a> is missing dialogue.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub-dialogue\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? Click <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Silver_Moon%3F_Crimson_Moon%3F?action=edit\">here</a> to add more.<div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\" style=\"font-size:small\">Quest + Dialogue + Location + Page Layout</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-stub-dialogue\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Silver Moon? Crimson Moon?</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Exploration</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Complete Main Act; <a href=\"/wiki/The_Sacred_Breeze_So_Often_Breathes\" title=\"The Sacred Breeze So Often Breathes\">The Sacred Breeze So Often Breathes</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Moon_Grove\" title=\"Silver Moon Grove\">Silver Moon Grove</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\nDefeat the five scattered Knights for their respective swords. Grants the achievement; <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Twilight\" title=\"Crimson Twilight\">Crimson Twilight</a> and unlocks the Phantom Echo; <a href=\"/wiki/Questless_Knight\" title=\"Questless Knight\">Questless Knight</a>. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Pedestal\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pedestal</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#The_Five_Knights_and_Memory_Fragments\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Five Knights and Memory Fragments</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Approach_the_lake\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Approach the lake</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Inspect_pedestals\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Inspect pedestals</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Complete_delivering_all_five_swords\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Complete delivering all five swords</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Abby:</b> (Are we walking on water now?)</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), I smell something weird, right under our feet!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (Could there be something hidden under water? I should look around.)</dd></dl>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>Abby:</b> What is this? An empty sword pedestal? There are more of them nearby.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> The swords are all missing.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> So, we need to find those swords to get things moving, huh? But where are we gonna find them?</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> On the pedestal, there's a tale about a knight called \"Silver Moon.\" Maybe we can discover something at the places recorded.</dd></dl>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Inspect the sword on the lake)</dt>\n<dd>When the scorching sun falls, the silver moon shall rise again.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> \"When the scorching sun falls, the silver moon shall rise again.\" ...What does that mean?</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> When the sun falls... It should mean the time around sunset. But why \"rise again?\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> The sun's setting soon. We'll wait and find out!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Pickup Sword at 17ː00-18ː00 and defeat the Knight of Crimson Moon)</dt>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> That knight's truly somethin'! But what happened between him and the five knights we met before? And why did they take his swords?</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> My guess is that the five knights represent the trials this knight once faced. After he died, those memories transformed into Tacet Discords.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Aha, that adds up!</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Then... did this knight pass his trials or not?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>: Maybe only the \"Silver Moon\" himself knows.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>: The truth behind the legends can often be misleading.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Maybe. Being a knight sounds super exhasting, one challenge after another...</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> It's those challenges that made his title truly worthy.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> I see! So if we keep facing every challenge, our names will have a lot more worth as well! Alright then, we've got a long journey ahead!</dd></dl>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pedestal\">Pedestal</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Sword_of_Courage\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Sword of Courage</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Sword_of_Mercy\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Sword of Mercy</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Sword_of_Honor\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Sword of Honor</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Sword_of_Generosity\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Sword of Generosity</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Sword_of_Wisdom\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Sword of Wisdom</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span id=\".5BSword_of_Courage_Pedestal.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Sword_of_Courage_Pedestal]\">[Sword of Courage Pedestal]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let this pedestal stand as a testament!<br />\nHere, the Knightly Virtue of Courage endures!<br />\nIt is told that the knight \"Silver Moon,\" in his youth, singlehandedly&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93; fought a victorious battle against an entire pack of ferocious TDs near <span style=\"color: yellow;\">the great tree to northwest of Egla Town.</span><br />\nCourage is the knight's final weapon.<br />\n</p>\n<dl><dt>(Deliver <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sword of Courage (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3dvcmRfb2ZfQ291cmFnZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Sword of Courage</span>)<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></dt></dl></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span id=\".5BSword_of_Mercy_Pedestal.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Sword_of_Mercy_Pedestal]\">[Sword of Mercy Pedestal]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let this pedestal stand as a testament!<br />\nHere, the Knightly Virtue of Mercy endures!<br />\nIt is told that the knight \"Silver Moon\" once stood vigil to <span style=\"color: yellow;\">the west of Mistveil Bay,</span> guarding the merchants who passed through. There, he drove away the fierce TDs and vanquished the ruthless Alari family.<br />\nTo show mercy to the innocent, one must be merciless to the wicked. <br />\n</p>\n<dl><dt>(Deliver <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sword of Atrocity (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3dvcmRfb2ZfQXRyb2NpdHk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Sword of Atrocity</span>)<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></dt></dl></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span id=\".5BSword_of_Honor_Pedestal.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Sword_of_Honor_Pedestal]\">[Sword of Honor Pedestal]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let this pedestal stand as a testament!<br />\nHere, the Knightly Virtue of Honor endures!<br />\nIt is told that the knight \"Silver Moon\" once dueled on <span style=\"color: yellow;\">the bridge leading to the Thorncrown Rises near Egla Town,</span> where he bested a hundred challengers.<br />\nHonor is a fine blade tempered in the fires of challenge.<br />\n</p>\n<dl><dt>(Deliver <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sword of Vanity (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3dvcmRfb2ZfVmFuaXR5P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Sword of Vanity</span>)<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></dt></dl></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span id=\".5BSword_of_Generosity_Pedestal.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Sword_of_Generosity_Pedestal]\">[Sword of Generosity Pedestal]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let this pedestal stand as a testament!<br />\nHere, the Knightly Virtue of Generosity endures!<br />\nIt is told that the knight \"Silver Moon,\" in his valiant struggle to protect the land from TDs, emptied his own coffers and called upon the people to donate. The gathered wealth was displayed in the <span style=\"color: yellow;\">cottage by the windmill</span> and used to fortify defenses which, at only a modest cost, repelled the TD assault.<br />\nIn giving, one finds reward.<br />\n</p>\n<dl><dt>(Deliver <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sword of Greed (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3dvcmRfb2ZfR3JlZWQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Sword of Greed</span>)<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></dt></dl></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span id=\".5BSword_of_Wisdom_Pedestal.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Sword_of_Wisdom_Pedestal]\">[Sword of Wisdom Pedestal]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let this pedestal stand as a testament!<br />\nHere, the Knightly Virtue of Wisdom, endures!<br />\nIt is told that the knight \"Silver Moon\", in his time, devoted himself to the study of the knightly path in <span style=\"color: yellow;\">Silver Moon Grove.</span> Over the years, he wrote volumes on what he learned, so that future knights might follow his teachings.<br />\nTo the wise, fate serves; to the foolish, fate rules. <br />\n</p>\n<dl><dt>(Deliver <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sword of Ignorance (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3dvcmRfb2ZfSWdub3JhbmNlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Sword of Ignorance</span>)<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></dt></dl></div></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Five_Knights_and_Memory_Fragments\">The Five Knights and Memory Fragments</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Knight_of_Cowardice\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Knight of Cowardice</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Knight_of_Atrocity\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Knight of Atrocity</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Knight_of_Vanity\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Knight of Vanity</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Knight_of_Greed\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Knight of Greed</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Knight_of_Ignorance\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Knight of Ignorance</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knight_of_Cowardice\">Knight of Cowardice</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>Check the source of the noise in the bush</dt>\n<dd><b>Knight of Cowardice:</b> Eek! Who are you?! Leave me alone!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Are you hiding from something?</dd>\n<dd><b>Knight of Cowardice:</b> Plushies! Hordes of them, with pointy horns!</dd>\n<dd><b>Knight of Cowardice:</b> You look like a mighty one. Could you drive them all away, please?</dd>\n<dd><b>Knight of Cowardice:</b> Please, I beg of you! Chase away those Plushies and I'll give you everything I have, even my sword!</dd>\n<dt>Defeat the Plushies surrounding the Swordː (0/4)</dt>\n<dt>Pick up the dusted sword</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BMemory_Fragment_1.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Memory_Fragment_1]\">[Memory Fragment 1]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>On the first full moon of my knighthood, I was defeated by a band of Plushies. The big Plushie was more terrifying than I imagined―a slight hesitation almost cost me my life. I was lucky to survive. But Sentinel, I ask you to witness how I conquer my fear and become unyielding. Under your divine gaze, I will forge myself into the very embodiment of the Five Knightly Virtues!\n</p>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knight_of_Atrocity\">Knight of Atrocity</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Approach the Knight)</dt>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Woah! All these <a href=\"/wiki/Fractsidus\" title=\"Fractsidus\">Fractsidus</a> fellas lying on the ground... Was it that big guy's doing?</dd>\n<dd><b>Knight of Atrocity:</b> Force... is justice... Force... is mercy!</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BMemory_Fragment_2.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Memory_Fragment_2]\">[Memory Fragment 2]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\nOn the forty-second full moon of my knighthood, a young man stabbed the right of my abdomen. In retaliation, I took his life. The Order rewarded my killings and celebrated my bloodlust. Yet Sentinel, if my words reach you, I beg for clarity: is mercy the path to saving grace or a swift descent into an early grave?<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knight_of_Vanity\">Knight of Vanity</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Enter the bridge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Knight of Vanity:</b> Come. Fight me, and fall before me.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BMemory_Fragment_3.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Memory_Fragment_3]\">[Memory Fragment 3]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\nOn the ninetieth full moon of my knighthood, I was assigned to duel on the great bridge. Day after day, knights came to challenge me, only to fall again and again―all to hasten my so-called glory of a hundred victories. O Sentinel, do you hear me? The weight of honor grows heavier, yet my sword feels ever more brittle.<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knight_of_Greed\">Knight of Greed</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Open any of the chests)</dt>\n<dd><b>Knight of Greed:</b> All those who profess to be generous... give everything you possess!</dd>\n<dt>(Defeat the Knight of Greed)</dt>\n<dd>Mine... all mine...</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BMemory_Fragment_4.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Memory_Fragment_4]\">[Memory Fragment 4]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\nOn the ninety-fifth full moon of my knighthood, I managed to gather fifteen crates of donations. After giving dues to the Order and the family I serve, only five remained. Even with the three crates I donated... No, it's not enough. It's nowhere near enough! O Sentinel, please enlighten me: why do the greediest souls always hide behind the banner of generosity?<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knight_of_Ignorance\">Knight of Ignorance</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Idle and Dialogue)</dt>\n<dd><b>Knight of Ignorance:</b> Now I understand... I understand it all...</dd>\n<dd><b>Knight of Ignorance:</b> There's no need to thinking whatsoever! I'll simply do whatever they command!</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<h3><span id=\".5BMemory_Fragment_5.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"[Memory_Fragment_5]\">[Memory Fragment 5]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\nOn the hundred and forty-fourth full moon of my knighthood, I was ordered to write a book on an island―despite my illiteracy. I wanted to share my techniques for fighting Tacet Discords, but the Acolytes suggested I center my words around the Five Knightly Virtues. O Sentinel, perhaps you can't hear this, but in all my supposed wisdom, I might be the most foolish of all.<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Silver Moon? Crimson Moon?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">白月？绯月？</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/rev